        "version": "0.3.2",
        "publishedAt": "2026-05-26T13:33:55Z",
        "notes": "## 版本变更 / Changelog\n\n- fix: output device switch and change icon (#18) by @arnoldhao\n  - Related #13 中文\n  - 更新应用图标资源，包括 macOS、Windows、前端 app icon 和 Windows tray icon。\n  - 修复 macOS 均衡器切换输出设备时的处理逻辑，提升输出设备切换后的音频路由稳定性。\n  - 降低 Listen / Muse 视频模式的 CPU 占用，避免 YouTube Music 视频模式下持续逐帧执行 DOM enforcement。\n  - 将播放器媒体模式扩展为 cover / lyrics / video，让视频模式和歌词模式都能跨歌曲保持用户意图；无视频或无歌词歌曲不会清掉当前模式。\n  - 修复 Muse 播放中进入缓冲时，播放状态被错误同步为暂停的问题，避免播放按钮从暂停变成播放图标。\n  - 增加回归测试覆盖 Muse buffering 状态同步。\n  - English\n  - Refresh app icon assets, including macOS, Windows, frontend app icons, and the Windows tray icon.\n  - Fix macOS equalizer output device switching to improve audio routing stability after output changes.\n  - Reduce CPU usage in Listen / Muse video mode by avoiding continuous per-frame DOM enforcement in the YouTube Music video view.\n  - Extend player media mode to cover / lyrics / video, preserving video and lyrics mode intent across tracks; tracks without video or lyrics no longer clear the selected mode.\n  - Fix Muse playback state syncing during buffering so active playback is not incorrectly downgraded to paused, preventing the play button from switching from pause to play.\n  - Add regression coverage for Muse buffering state synchronization.",
        "releasePage": "https://github.com/arnoldhao/xiadown/releases/tag/v0.3.2",
